<title>POLAND: Polish Impexmetal up 2.8 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Polish Impexmetal up 2.8 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish metals trader Impexmetal SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw bourse at 37 zlotys, 2.8 percent higher than its April initial public offering price of 36 zlotys.</p>
<p>Entering bourse trade are the 3,189,171 new shares of the public offering and 6,325,190 series A shares, 2,994,142 of which the state sold in May at the same price as the IPO, which was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
